# Miscellaneous
/static/

# Rust / Tauri build artifacts. Cargo writes generated JS + JSON under
# `src-tauri/target/.../build/.../out/` that Prettier walks into and
# fails to parse. CI passes without this only because CI starts with
# an empty target dir.
src-tauri/target/
# Tauri-generated capability + permission schemas — rewritten by
# `tauri build` / `tauri dev`, not hand-authored.
src-tauri/gen/
# Rewritten by the Update Download Links workflow on every release, which
# emits 2-space JSON — not hand-authored, so don't let it trip the lint gate.
docs/downloads.json

# Local-only Claude Code state — never tracked, per-developer.
.claude/settings.local.json
